1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 20=

8
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:50,780
No!

9
00:00:52,579 --> 00:00:53,840
This is Shanbo's

10
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:55,780
blood.

11
00:00:59,259 --> 00:01:00,259
No!

12
00:01:03,079 --> 00:01:04,280
Shanbo.

13
00:01:05,319 --> 00:01:06,439
He's given up.

14
00:01:07,019 --> 00:01:08,200
He doesn't deserve your love.

15
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:10,299
You deserve a better life,

16
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:12,980
not to drown in such petty romance.

17
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:15,379
You should bring glory to our family

18
00:01:15,620 --> 00:01:17,760
and rise to the very top step by step.

19
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:20,099
This is the mission our family gave you,

20
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:22,379
and what we expect of you.

21
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:25,000
Hate me or resent me,

22
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:27,980
nothing will ever change.

23
00:01:48,659 --> 00:01:51,400
His heart is failing.
He only has days left.

24
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:53,439
Please forgive my incompetence.

25
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:55,780
You should prepare for the funeral.

26
00:02:01,219 --> 00:02:02,239
My son.

27
00:02:03,260 --> 00:02:05,260
His heart has already broken.

28
00:02:06,319 --> 00:02:10,020
Son, you must pull yourself together.

29
00:02:10,259 --> 00:02:14,379
Seeing you like this,
how am I supposed to hold on?

30
00:02:16,379 --> 00:02:17,379
My son.

31
00:02:18,860 --> 00:02:22,599
Can't Dong's Revitalizing Pill
save Lord Liang?

32
00:02:22,939 --> 00:02:24,539
Lord Liang is so pitiful.

33
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:29,419
Watching her son die helplessly,

34
00:02:29,719 --> 00:02:31,259
his mother's heart must be breaking.

35
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:34,060
Only Dong can save Lord Liang.

36
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:36,819
Hanyan, let's go
to the capital to find him.

37
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:39,919
But the capital is so far away.

38
00:02:40,379 --> 00:02:42,620
I'm afraid before we even reach Dong,

39
00:02:43,159 --> 00:02:44,159
Lord Liang will be...

40
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,560
Darlings,

41
00:02:46,199 --> 00:02:48,599
such sad faces don't suit your beauty.

42
00:02:48,599 --> 00:02:49,599
- Dong!
- Dong!

43
00:02:50,284 --> 00:02:51,840
You're finally back, Dong!

44
00:02:52,060 --> 00:02:53,360
Please save Lord Liang.

45
00:02:54,860 --> 00:02:56,340
No matter how powerful I am,

46
00:02:57,319 --> 00:02:58,599
I can't save a breaking heart.

47
00:02:59,259 --> 00:03:00,259
But...

48
00:03:03,379 --> 00:03:04,659
You are Master Zhao?

49
00:03:05,099 --> 00:03:06,960
Please save my son!

50
00:03:07,419 --> 00:03:10,099
Madam, he needs the medicine
for the breaking heart.

51
00:03:10,979 --> 00:03:12,039
I will do my best.

52
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:25,439
Consumed by love's trial,

53
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:27,060
his heart meridians are shattered.

54
00:03:28,219 --> 00:03:29,419
Without my Revitalizing Pill

55
00:03:29,699 --> 00:03:31,159
sustaining his life,

56
00:03:31,639 --> 00:03:32,800
he would have died already.

57
00:03:38,780 --> 00:03:40,000
Unblock the heart gate!

58
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,560
He's awake!

59
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:52,620
Great, Lord Liang is awake!

60
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:55,560
Liang Shanbo,
is this all the spine you have?

61
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,639
Let family status prejudice

62
00:03:57,919 --> 00:03:58,919
and brute authority

63
00:03:59,340 --> 00:04:00,419
shatter your faith?

64
00:04:01,340 --> 00:04:02,939
You claim you love Zhu Yingnan,

65
00:04:03,539 --> 00:04:05,780
yet you lack the guts
to defy the authority for her.

66
00:04:06,979 --> 00:04:07,979
If you die,

67
00:04:08,740 --> 00:04:10,699
she'll still be forced
to marry that spoiled scum

68
00:04:11,219 --> 00:04:12,219
and die in sorrow.

69
00:04:12,740 --> 00:04:16,100
Is your so-called love
making her endure all this alone?

70
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:22,560
Look at your mother.

71
00:04:23,579 --> 00:04:25,319
Look at all the people relying on you.

72
00:04:26,220 --> 00:04:28,699
Your life doesn't belong just to you.

73
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:31,899
Rise like a man

74
00:04:32,620 --> 00:04:34,079
and win back the woman you love.

75
00:04:34,779 --> 00:04:35,899
If this world is unjust,

76
00:04:36,500 --> 00:04:38,920
then you and I will rewrite the rules!

77
00:04:54,899 --> 00:04:57,680
Mr. Zhao, you're right.

78
00:04:58,519 --> 00:04:59,600
I understand now.

79
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,360
I'm glad then.

80
00:05:03,180 --> 00:05:05,180
I have stabilized your body,

81
00:05:05,779 --> 00:05:08,779
but you must solve the problem yourself.

82
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:17,560
The Zhu family is truly despicable!

83
00:05:17,959 --> 00:05:19,199
They tore lovers apart,

84
00:05:19,459 --> 00:05:21,180
and even insulted us as lowly women,

85
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:23,040
unworthy of even talking to them.

86
00:05:23,279 --> 00:05:24,500
In all my life,

87
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:25,860
no one dares to say that to me.

88
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:29,600
Dong, you must vent our anger.

89
00:05:29,899 --> 00:05:33,560
Besides, we don't want
to see lovers torn apart.

90
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:37,819
You can help them, right?

91
00:05:39,139 --> 00:05:40,699
Brightest of all are sun and moon.

92
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:42,759
Dearest and most distant,
husband and wife.

93
00:05:43,199 --> 00:05:45,100
Whether they end up together

94
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,540
depends on them.

95
00:05:47,439 --> 00:05:49,959
But if you don't help them,

96
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:53,639
how can they overcome
the family status prejudice?

97
00:05:53,819 --> 00:05:56,600
I can step in
to change their tragic fate,

98
00:05:56,899 --> 00:05:57,939
giving them a loving life.

99
00:05:59,279 --> 00:06:02,060
Yet recently, I had a new realization.

100
00:06:03,100 --> 00:06:04,120
In one's life,

101
00:06:04,959 --> 00:06:06,019
joys, sorrows, partings, unions,

102
00:06:06,019 --> 00:06:07,160
birth, age, sickness, and death,

103
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:09,000
are something they have to go through.

104
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:10,819
Only by walking the path,

105
00:06:11,100 --> 00:06:12,100
crossing the mountains,

106
00:06:12,839 --> 00:06:13,839
and parting the mist,

107
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,120
can one see their true self.

108
00:06:17,439 --> 00:06:19,279
Fate is just a script.

109
00:06:20,019 --> 00:06:21,279
Only by seeing one's true self

110
00:06:21,579 --> 00:06:22,920
can one break free from it.

111
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,660
That's too profound.

112
00:06:27,459 --> 00:06:28,579
I don't understand.

113
00:06:30,220 --> 00:06:31,399
Why don't you

114
00:06:31,819 --> 00:06:36,000
come home and explain it
to me in detail tonight?

115
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,160
Let's go home...

116
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:38,160
Wan'er,

117
00:06:38,279 --> 00:06:40,459
stop saying such embarrassing things.

118
00:06:42,839 --> 00:06:43,839
Dong,

119
00:06:43,839 --> 00:06:46,420
did your trip to the capital
go smoothly?

120
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:50,160
I knew you couldn't wait.

121
00:06:50,980 --> 00:06:53,079
Your father was not only
cleared of all charges,

122
00:06:53,399 --> 00:06:54,759
but also promoted three ranks.

123
00:06:56,779 --> 00:06:59,339
Wonderful! Father...

124
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,639
Why are you crying?

125
00:07:06,139 --> 00:07:08,759
Thank you, Dong.

126
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:10,959
Without you,

127
00:07:11,639 --> 00:07:14,560
Father might have died
wrongfully in prison,

128
00:07:15,540 --> 00:07:19,279
and I would have fallen into ruin.

129
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:25,540
I think that meeting you
has exhausted all the luck of my life.

130
00:07:34,019 --> 00:07:37,300
Yan, I really envy you.

131
00:07:38,079 --> 00:07:42,199
I am the only one left in my family.

132
00:07:46,759 --> 00:07:47,800
Wan'er,

133
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:50,959
Dong, Cuicui, and I,

134
00:07:51,319 --> 00:07:52,779
we are all your family.

135
00:08:01,279 --> 00:08:03,279
By the way, where is our maid?

136
00:08:04,100 --> 00:08:06,360
I don't know. She suddenly vanished.

137
00:08:06,579 --> 00:08:07,759
I've been worried about her.

138
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:22,379
I knew she would
face such a tribulation.

139
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,540
The White Tiger, corpse in jaws.

140
00:08:25,819 --> 00:08:26,980
Yin fire and yang torture.

141
00:08:27,379 --> 00:08:28,379
Loss of body,

142
00:08:28,959 --> 00:08:29,959
shattered spirit,

143
00:08:30,759 --> 00:08:31,759
broken life.

144
00:08:33,799 --> 00:08:34,799
Dire omen!

145
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:36,480
This...

146
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:38,759
Dong, I don't quite understand.

147
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:41,679
Do you mean

148
00:08:42,419 --> 00:08:45,000
she faces a deadly tribulation?

149
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,480
Right.

150
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,200
What should we do?

151
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:51,120
Lord Liang's matter is urgent too.

152
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,240
Dong,

153
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:54,860
you can't handle two things at once.

154
00:08:56,139 --> 00:08:59,120
She must cross
her tribulation by herself.

155
00:09:05,700 --> 00:09:07,960
I'm asking you one last time.

156
00:09:08,299 --> 00:09:10,679
That True Immortal
is from the upper realm.

157
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:13,559
His favor is the greatest glory
for you and Zixia Sect.

158
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:16,039
Why are you so obstinate?

159
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:17,259
Glory?

160
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,159
In your eyes,

161
00:09:19,779 --> 00:09:21,519
is my marriage just a bargaining chip

162
00:09:21,519 --> 00:09:22,879
to buy glory for the sect?

163
00:09:22,879 --> 00:09:24,899
You fool! What do you want?

164
00:09:25,259 --> 00:09:27,200
You just want to be a maid

165
00:09:27,299 --> 00:09:28,759
for that unknown rogue cultivator?

166
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,039
You have the talent

167
00:09:30,220 --> 00:09:31,220
and a boundless future.

168
00:09:31,259 --> 00:09:32,460
How could you ruin yourself?

169
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:35,159
Master's power
is beyond your imagination.

170
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:37,700
I acknowledge only him in this life.

171
00:09:38,139 --> 00:09:39,620
Your so-called True Immortal

172
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:41,639
isn't worth a fraction of him
in my eyes.

173
00:09:42,340 --> 00:09:43,960
Even if you kill me today,

174
00:09:44,379 --> 00:09:45,559
I will never yield.

175
00:09:45,559 --> 00:09:48,419
Insolent!
Must you force me to torture you?

176
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,899
Besides that, what else can you do?

177
00:09:51,899 --> 00:09:52,899
Come on.

178
00:09:53,419 --> 00:09:55,139
If I break free from these bonds,

179
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,899
or if you loosen them,

180
00:09:57,519 --> 00:09:59,000
I will shatter my Golden Core

181
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,039
and destroy my soul!

182
00:10:00,639 --> 00:10:02,179
All you'll have left is a corpse.

183
00:10:02,419 --> 00:10:03,960
Let that True Immortal

184
00:10:04,259 --> 00:10:05,659
marry a corpse.

185
00:10:06,379 --> 00:10:10,580
H-How dare you threaten me with death?

186
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:13,039
Did I raise you with care
all these years in vain?

187
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:16,120
Did the sect nurture you
all this time for nothing?

188
00:10:16,639 --> 00:10:18,399
I have never forgotten

189
00:10:18,399 --> 00:10:19,740
your care and nurturing.

190
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,480
But, Father,

191
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:24,559
you are the one driving me to death,

192
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:27,779
sacrificing my marriage and will

193
00:10:27,779 --> 00:10:29,500
for some interests.

194
00:10:30,039 --> 00:10:31,700
Is this the sect's moral principle?

195
00:10:31,700 --> 00:10:32,700
Shut up!

196
00:10:33,139 --> 00:10:35,039
The sect's interests come
before everything.

197
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:36,799
Personal feelings are nothing.

198
00:10:37,179 --> 00:10:38,659
Since you remain obstinate,

199
00:10:40,259 --> 00:10:41,960
don't blame me then.

200
00:10:45,980 --> 00:10:46,980
Heart-Capturing Art!

201
00:10:47,019 --> 00:10:48,019
Zhang Lingfeng!

202
00:10:48,019 --> 00:10:50,080
You used such wicked art
on your own daughter?

203
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:51,899
You forced me to do so.

204
00:10:52,340 --> 00:10:55,500
I will make you willingly love
the True Immortal

205
00:10:55,779 --> 00:10:57,000
and forget that rogue cultivator.

206
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:59,259
No!

207
00:10:59,259 --> 00:11:01,200
I hate you, Zhang Lingfeng! I hate you!

208
00:11:09,159 --> 00:11:10,299
Master,

209
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:14,840
I would rather die than betray you.

210
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:29,840
Zhen, who do you love?

211
00:11:31,220 --> 00:11:34,720
I-I love...

212
00:11:53,138 --> 00:11:56,729
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

213
00:11:56,729 --> 00:11:59,516
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

214
00:12:00,092 --> 00:12:02,254
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

215
00:12:02,254 --> 00:12:05,100
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

216
00:12:05,100 --> 00:12:08,378
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

217
00:12:08,378 --> 00:12:10,012
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

218
00:12:10,012 --> 00:12:12,076
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

219
00:12:12,076 --> 00:12:13,612
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

220
00:12:13,612 --> 00:12:16,394
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

221
00:12:16,843 --> 00:12:18,748
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

222
00:12:18,748 --> 00:12:24,779
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

223
00:12:25,361 --> 00:12:29,244
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

224
00:12:29,244 --> 00:12:32,469
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

225
00:12:32,981 --> 00:12:35,580
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

226
00:12:35,580 --> 00:12:40,708
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

227
00:12:40,708 --> 00:12:44,236
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

228
00:12:44,236 --> 00:12:47,944
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

229
00:12:47,944 --> 00:12:49,836
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

230
00:12:49,836 --> 00:12:51,913
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

231
00:12:51,913 --> 00:12:54,444
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

232
00:12:54,444 --> 00:12:58,481
♪You met the most precious person♪

233
00:13:00,149 --> 00:13:02,012
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

234
00:13:02,012 --> 00:13:04,531
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

235
00:13:04,531 --> 00:13:05,980
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

236
00:13:05,980 --> 00:13:08,282
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

237
00:13:08,282 --> 00:13:10,252
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

238
00:13:10,252 --> 00:13:14,662
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

239
00:13:14,662 --> 00:13:16,204
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

240
00:13:16,204 --> 00:13:18,114
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

241
00:13:18,114 --> 00:13:21,388
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

242
00:13:21,388 --> 00:13:24,709
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

243
00:13:24,709 --> 00:13:26,444
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

244
00:13:26,444 --> 00:13:31,068
♪Just catch your breath first♪

245
00:13:31,068 --> 00:13:34,818
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

246
00:13:34,818 --> 00:13:38,196
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

247
00:13:38,570 --> 00:13:40,540
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

248
00:13:40,540 --> 00:13:46,287
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

249
00:13:46,287 --> 00:13:49,803
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

250
00:13:49,803 --> 00:13:51,372
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

251
00:13:51,372 --> 00:13:53,682
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

252
00:13:53,682 --> 00:13:55,420
♪From laughter to devotion♪

253
00:13:55,420 --> 00:13:57,476
♪From falling to innocence♪

254
00:13:57,476 --> 00:13:59,324
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

255
00:13:59,324 --> 00:14:05,994
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
